'' RUN: a method called on a BYREF property's result -- 'c.Parent.Has( k )', 'c.Parent.Parent.SetN( 11 )'
'' -- takes the returned pointer as THIS. The receiver was copied into a temporary through an unsized
'' aggregate load, and clang rejected the IR ('[0 x i8]'; fbc-examples r2ir01, fbJson). Expected
'' output measured with fbc-modern.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/byref-prop-receiver.bas -o tests/codegen/byrefpropreceiver.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/byrefpropreceiver.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/byrefpropreceiver.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: truefalse
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  11 13 7
